Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:35:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/26] fix(vertex): model-scoped 429 failover and sibling
 quota cooldown isolation

- Add vertex to _is_model_scoped_failure so 429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED isolates cooldown to the rate-limited model rather than exhausting the entire ADC credential
- Ensure PooledCredential.runtime_api_key resolves live Vertex ADC/OAuth tokens for unhydrated store entries
- Normalize and match model variants in model_cooldown_until (e.g. google/gemini-3.8-flash vs gemini-3.8-flash)
- Refine _candidate_pool_exhausted to allow sibling Vertex models to seamlessly receive failover requests
- Add comprehensive unit test suite in tests/agent/test_vertex_model_cooldowns.py
---
